(2, 'GME', 'photo_GME.jpg', '<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span lang=\"FR\" style=\"color: black; mso-ansi-language: FR;\">Les syst&egrave;mes industriels actuels font partie de beaucoup de secteurs industriels tels que l&rsquo;automobile, l&rsquo;a&eacute;ronautique, l&rsquo;agroalimentaire etc. ; leurs conception et pilotage deviennent de plus en plus complexes. La conception et le pilotage de ces syst&egrave;mes constituent des t&acirc;ches exigeantes et n&eacute;cessitent un ensemble d&rsquo;actions telles que : la conception, la configuration, l&rsquo;installation, la supervision et la commande. Les comp&eacute;tences n&eacute;cessaires &agrave; un pilotage efficace s&rsquo;&eacute;talent de la compr&eacute;hension de l&rsquo;architecture des syst&egrave;mes &agrave; concevoir ou &agrave; piloter jusqu&rsquo;au d&eacute;veloppement de nouveaux composants dans les syst&egrave;mes. </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span lang=\"FR\" style=\"color: black; mso-ansi-language: FR;\">Former des techniciens qui soient rapidement op&eacute;rationnels, capables de concevoir, d&eacute;velopper et piloter la plupart de syst&egrave;mes industriels. Ces syst&egrave;mes peuvent &ecirc;tre des logiciels ou du mat&eacute;riel, &agrave; ressources riches ou embarqu&eacute;s et soumises &agrave; des exigences de temps-r&eacute;el et de s&eacute;curit&eacute;.</span></p>', '<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span lang=\"FR\" style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: DE;\">Fili&egrave;re :</span></strong><span lang=\"FR\" style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: DE;\"> <strong>Conception et Pilotage des Syst&egrave;mes Industriels (CPSI)</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span lang=\"FR\" style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: DE;\">Dur&eacute;e&nbsp;:</span></strong><span lang=\"FR\" style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: DE;\"> 3 ans (6 semestres)</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span lang=\"FR\" style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: DE;\">Objectif de la formation&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; text-indent: 35.4pt; line-height: normal;\"><span lang=\"FR\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: DE;\">Les syst&egrave;mes industriels actuels font partie de beaucoup de secteurs industriels tels que l&rsquo;automobile, l&rsquo;a&eacute;ronautique, l&rsquo;agroalimentaire etc. ; leurs conception et pilotage deviennent de plus en plus complexes. La conception et le pilotage de ces syst&egrave;mes constituent des t&acirc;ches exigeantes et n&eacute;cessitent un ensemble d&rsquo;actions telles que : la conception, la configuration, l&rsquo;installation, la supervision et la commande. Les comp&eacute;tences n&eacute;cessaires &agrave; un pilotage efficace s&rsquo;&eacute;talent de la compr&eacute;hension de l&rsquo;architecture des syst&egrave;mes &agrave; concevoir ou &agrave; piloter jusqu&rsquo;au d&eacute;veloppement de nouveaux composants dans les syst&egrave;mes.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; text-indent: 35.4pt; line-height: normal;\"><span lang=\"FR\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: DE;\">Former des techniciens qui soient rapidement op&eacute;rationnels, capables de concevoir, d&eacute;velopper et piloter la plupart de syst&egrave;mes industriels. Ces syst&egrave;mes peuvent &ecirc;tre des logiciels ou du mat&eacute;riel, &agrave; ressources riches ou embarqu&eacute;s et soumises &agrave; des exigences de temps-r&eacute;el et de s&eacute;curit&eacute;.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span lang=\"FR\" style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: DE;\">Fili&egrave;re&nbsp;:</span></strong><span lang=\"FR\" style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: DE;\"> <strong>Technico-commercial Automobile (TCT)</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span lang=\"FR\" style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: DE;\">Dur&eacute;e&nbsp;:</span></strong><span lang=\"FR\" style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: DE;\"> 3 ans (6 semestres)</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span lang=\"FR\" style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: DE;\">Objectif de la formation&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span lang=\"FR\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: DE;\">En tant que technico-commercial et interface entre les services de production et le service vente, &ecirc;tre capable de :</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: normal;\"><span lang=\"FR\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: DE;\">&middot;</span><span lang=\"FR\" style=\"font-size: 7.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: DE;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span lang=\"FR\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: DE;\">Vendre des solutions techniques,</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: normal;\"><span lang=\"FR\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: DE;\">&middot;</span><span lang=\"FR\" style=\"font-size: 7.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: DE;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span lang=\"FR\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: DE;\">D&eacute;velopper la client&egrave;le,</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: normal;\"><span lang=\"FR\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: DE;\">&middot;</span><span lang=\"FR\" style=\"font-size: 7.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: DE;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span lang=\"FR\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: DE;\">G&eacute;rer de l&rsquo;information,</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: normal;\"><span lang=\"FR\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: DE;\">&middot;</span><span lang=\"FR\" style=\"font-size: 7.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: DE;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span lang=\"FR\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: DE;\">Management une &eacute;quipe et</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: normal;\"><span lang=\"FR\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: DE;\">&middot;</span><span lang=\"FR\" style=\"font-size: 7.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: DE;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span lang=\"FR\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: DE;\">Mettre en &oelig;uvre de la politique commerciale de l&rsquo;entreprise.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: normal;\"><span lang=\"FR\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: DE;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span lang=\"FR\" style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: DE;\">Fili&egrave;re&nbsp;:</span></strong><span lang=\"FR\" style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: DE;\"> <strong>V&eacute;hicules Electrique, Syst&egrave;mes Autonomes et Connect&eacute;s (VESAC)</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span lang=\"FR\" style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: DE;\">Dur&eacute;e&nbsp;:</span></strong><span lang=\"FR\" style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: DE;\"> 3 ans (6 semestres)</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span lang=\"FR\" style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: DE;\">Objectif de la formation&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; text-indent: 35.4pt; line-height: normal;\"><span lang=\"FR\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: DE; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Acqu&eacute;rir les comp&eacute;tences n&eacute;cessaires pour concevoir et d&eacute;velopper des syst&egrave;mes &eacute;lectroniques embarqu&eacute;s d&eacute;di&eacute;s au v&eacute;hicule autonome pour les secteurs automobile, a&eacute;ronautique, robotique mobil.</span></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span lang=\"FR-CM\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-ansi-language: FR-CM; mso-fareast-language: DE;\">Identifier les technologies : v&eacute;hicules connect&eacute;s et autonomes, aides &agrave; la conduite (ADAS), limites &agrave; leur mise en &oelig;uvre et leur potentiel d&rsquo;application</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span lang=\"FR-CM\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-ansi-language: FR-CM; mso-fareast-language: DE;\">Expliquer les aspects fonctionnels des v&eacute;hicules auto